==Battleground==
*9 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 85.33 seconds<sup>2,560f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*4 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 18.67~22 seconds<sup>560f~660f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat/Catasaurus]] or literally other any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] for the Metal Hippoe. Once they're gone, you're free to take care of the Traitless enemy spam.

